  "intro": [
    "Every EFS operation the emulator advertises, and what Emuplane does with it.",
    "The service is REST/JSON under `/2015-02-01/*`, signed with the",
    "`elasticfilesystem` credential scope, and has no console action. A file system",
    "is idempotent on its `CreationToken`; mount targets are records checked against",
    "the EC2 subnet, security groups and zone; replication creates records and copies",
    "nothing, and a file system in a replication configuration cannot be deleted."
